        "title": "The graph shows the average monthly change in the prices of three metals during 2014. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YblfdoKBVoJ0oBxPfRVlLnAig4c\"><em><strong>The graph shows the average monthly change in the prices of three metals during 2014.</strong> <strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. </strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Monthly Price Changes of Metals: 2014</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ItVldtCx0op4ggxMZ6HlCEkggZb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><a href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/170/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570?collection=lesson&amp;item=25\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xc6JdDc6OoyCNrxCJmXl5ny0gnh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Monthly Price Changes of Metals: 2014 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về sự thay đổi gi&aacute; cả của ba kim loại - đồng, niken v&agrave; kẽm - trong năm 2014.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NKihd8ZOXoPhmzxLDyPlzvG9gYo\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L6Lld4SqroiQSrxWP7elDN6Mgug\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Monthly Price Changes of Metals: 2014 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: phần trăm thay đổi h&agrave;ng th&aacute;ng - gi&aacute; ba kim loại - đồng, niken v&agrave; kẽm - 2014.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KnOrdY0TFou8h2xCEZNl06vlgud\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><strong><a href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/124/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570-internal?collection=lesson&amp;item=26\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hg8DdEKIaoViIsxzmpCljmrugWf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Cả ba kim loại đều c&oacute; sự biến động về gi&aacute; trong suốt năm, nh&igrave;n chung giảm v&agrave;o những th&aacute;ng giữa năm v&agrave; c&oacute; dấu hiệu phục hồi v&agrave;o cuối năm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UhfwdDUODohQSsxkZy8lToEIg5d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Gi&aacute; niken biến động mạnh nhất, đạt đỉnh v&agrave;o đầu năm trước khi giảm mạnh ở giữa năm.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLrHdc701owzfzxHR4Al2Nq3ggc\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"10\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"11\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"12\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</span></div>\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RWbEd9Zz4o5daexcwySlKSBfgTc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Nickel</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AiIHdpZv1o4YxOxZqqKlTxB8gJd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PjySdKmfdoPloWx9GkTlY94QgCh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu đầu năm </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>cao nhất</strong></em><em> ở 6% v&agrave;o January, sau đ&oacute; </em><em><strong>giảm mạnh</strong></em><em> c&ograve;n 4% v&agrave;o February)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I8b1dNLxEo8B9yx4t2Fl6dzFgTh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng đến hết năm </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>duy tr&igrave; ổn định</strong></em><em> quanh 1% từ March đến May, sau đ&oacute; </em><em><strong>giảm mạnh nhất</strong></em><em> xuống c&ograve;n -3% v&agrave;o June, sau đ&oacute; </em><em><strong>dần tăng lại</strong></em><em> đến 1% ở điểm cuối năm)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMAGdlHtOoSFpCx9IcOlPJTJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VY8Vd8h5aobxxpxPMEPlRpFpghd\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W5DUdurA2oeCjZx4oPplDV0VgDc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Copper v&agrave; Zinc</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M31zdIWfcotveTxSgFnlgj3ggPg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XPDadtiZooImD1xLVrLlj4y0g2b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu th&aacute;ng đầu </strong><em>(zinc ở mức 1% v&agrave; copper ở 2% v&agrave;o January)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CFPAdkfIDopm2VxhonyleC8CgQH\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của zinc </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng </strong></em><em>l&ecirc;n 3% v&agrave;o February, </em><em><strong>giảm </strong></em><em>c&ograve;n -1% v&agrave;o June, v&agrave; </em><em><strong>ổn định</strong></em><em> trong bốn th&aacute;ng tiếp theo)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OQE8diCXJoxWkBxCi6MlFUqfgpg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của copper</strong> <em>(thay đổi &iacute;t đột ngột hơn, </em><em><strong>dao động</strong></em><em> giữa 0% v&agrave; 1% trong phần lớn c&aacute;c th&aacute;ng)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mh7zdgYjCo7Z7WxLEUYlpUBzgLg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>số liệu th&aacute;ng cuối</strong> <em>(cả hai c&oacute; mức tăng gi&aacute; </em><em><strong>tương tự</strong></em><em> khoảng 2% v&agrave;o December)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CV8QdQzd6oJPp9xPKp5lSY3ugLc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn n&oacute;i về sự <strong>\"thay đổi về gi&aacute;\"</strong> của kim loại, thay v&igrave; lặp lại từ <strong>\"price change\"</strong> th&igrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"price increase/price drop/price fluctuation\"</strong> t&ugrave;y thuộc v&agrave;o trường hợp gi&aacute; tăng hay giảm cho đa dạng th&ecirc;m nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NSj5dOtiFoSGQrxD7ltl2MR1goh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HFB7d32Z1ocsgtxUUIrl1lTIgo1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PAJVd3snEoYhiGxjEenlKfiPgtb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">... all three metals experienced <strong>price fluctuations</strong> throughout the year...</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pj2xd3qCsonXsaxd0qOlsG5Ogfe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">... nickel saw its sharpest <strong>price drop</strong> to -3% in June...</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TovgdQ5H2oFSsIxfhzSl1P8ygGd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Regarding the other two metals, both zinc and copper began 2014 with modest <strong>price increases</strong> of about 1% and 2% respectively.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 797,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DzsgdFdYFoIY4fx7oIvlcwJhgkP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-REjbdCLupo6L5dxAVI2ll6moghc\">The line graph depicts monthly percentage changes in the prices of three metals - copper, nickel, and zinc - throughout 2014.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14122,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 798,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FPqvdE9PuoUaomx8WmZlgEo4gPb\">Overall, while all three metals experienced price fluctuations throughout the year, their values generally declined in the middle months before showing signs of recovery towards the end of the period. The most dramatic variations were seen in nickel prices, which peaked early in the year before sharply declining by mid-year.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14122,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 799,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PbhUdVswZokoyoxil4cln07agrb\">Looking at nickel specifically, this metal recorded the highest monthly price increase of approximately 6% in January, followed by a steep decline to approximately 4% in February. After maintaining relatively stable price changes around 1% from March to May, nickel saw its sharpest price drop to -3% in June, before gradually recovering to end the year at roughly 1% above the previous month's price.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14122,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 800,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VAM3dTX1pobmU4xM1W4lGAy1gEe\">Regarding the other two metals, both zinc and copper began 2014 with modest price increases of about 1% and 2% respectively. Zinc then rose to nearly 3% in February before declining to -1% in June and leveled off for the next four months. Meanwhile, copper showed less dramatic changes, fluctuating between 0% and 1% for most of the year. By December, both metals recorded similar price increases of approximately 2%.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14122,
